ry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="93" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coloured box = entity of this area with its identifying and key attributes and business rules; white box = related entity of another area (its own page has the details).&lt;br&gt;Relationship name is read from the first entity to the second; crow's foot at both ends: | one · O zero · &amp;lt; many.&lt;br&gt;Grey dashed box, line or attribute «planned» = in Register v1.4, not in code yet (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017). Removed items: Notes of Figure 3.3." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="930" width="1226" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="94" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead (Batch opening condition, box rows and row allocation)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1009" width="1226" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="A3 · Production, evidence and alerts" id="A3___Production__evidence_and_alerts"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 3.3.3 – Conceptual ERD: Production, evidence and alerts (Register v1.4)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · crow's foot · 9 entities of A3 + 7 related entities of other areas (white boxes) · 19 relationships&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign